great item of writing, I’m sharing with my buddies.

=== Text #5 ===
> H[ul]en R. Loyd, Sept. 27, 1884 - Aug. 30, 1959. Margaret[ F]. Loyd, Aug., 24,[ 18]78 - Mar. 14, 1934. Hulen R. Loyd was a son of James[ S]. Loyd & Nancy or Martha Wil[k]erson. He married Margaret Finley McIntosh on Sept. 5, 1902 in[ Call]away Co., Missouri.[ She] was a daughter of William[ McInt]osh and Emma Finley.

=== Text #6 ===
> This dog[ bro]och pin is made with polymer clay, painted, and sealed[ with varnish] for protection. It is made and painted[ by] hand so each pin has some variation and is unique in its own way!
The pin is 1.5" x 1.5" with[ rubber clutch backing] and[ comes] with a[ backing] card.

=== Text #7 ===
